  "releaseNotes": "## Version 6.5.2 - May 6, 2025\n\n  - **Improved:** When saving a new image as TIFF, for example if it's created via Image.CreateMultiFrameImage so not loaded from an exting TIFF image,\n    ensure the most popular compression Lzw is used and not None.\n  \n  - **Improved:** Updated AWSSDK.S3 to 4.0.0.1\n    Major version change so watch out for side-effects (although tested)\n\n  - **Improved:** ComponentHandler.SendPage should directly write to response stream and not use fileResponse.Transmit\n    due to browser caching issues even for short time. SendPage is mainly used for errors like SessionExpired pages so prevent browser caching.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "title": "Common Library for GleamTech Products",
